# Wither (CR 702.80a, 120.3d) outside combat: Bushwhack's second mode has Bot1's Wildslayer Elves, a 3/3 with wither, fight
# Bot2's Stone Golem, a 4/4. The Elves deal 3 damage to the Golem as three -1/-1 counters, not as damage: it is a 1/1 with
# no damage marked, and survives. The Golem deals its 4 damage to the Elves as ordinary damage, which kills them.
# Bot1 casts the Elves on turn 1 (Black Lotus green and Mox Emerald); Bot2 casts the Golem on turn 2 (Black Lotus and Moxen
# Jet and Pearl). Bot1 casts Bushwhack on turn 3 (Mox Emerald again).

